dation model evidence.","evidence_snippet":"\"POSITION / RESEARCH-GAP NOTE\"; \"This note establishes no empirical result\""},{"record_id":"rec_000088","paper_type":"benchmark_resource","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"benchmark_resource","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a benchmarking study of existing pathology foundation models, not a new generative model paper. The abstract explicitly identifies the tested systems as foundation models.","evidence_snippet":"\"Benchmarking Open-Source Pathology Foundation Models\"; \"We evaluated two open-source pathology foundation models\""}]}
